    "detailed_description": "GWENT: Rogue Mage is a single-player expansion to GWENT: The Witcher Card Game combining the best elements of roguelike, deckbuilding, and strategy games with the unique mechanics of GWENT card battles.<br><br>Hundreds of years before Geralt and other witchers roamed the Continent, the Conjunction of the Spheres brought endless ranks of monsters into the world. Humanity desperately needed a way to fight back the onslaught to survive.<br><br>Follow the journey of a young and ambitious mage, Alzur, and his companion Lily, who embark on a dangerous quest to create a living weapon that will eradicate the monster threat once and for all.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1711950/extras/a38980e32cbbaaa07195b4a4934c9c70.webp?t=1749201262\" /></div><br><br><strong>No holding back:</strong> Battles last only one round, so players will need to use every trick up their sleeve to help Alzur stave off the onslaught.<br><br><strong>New resource \u2014 energy:</strong> Each turn, Alzur can cast powerful spells from his ever-expanding Grimoire by spending energy. It can be replenished between battles by visiting Places of Power or through random encounters on the map.<br><br><strong>Turning the tables:</strong> Alzur starts at a disadvantage by not being able to react to the opponents\u2019 final card play. By progressing the campaign and unlocking high-end bonuses, players can take complete control of the battle flow. <br><br><strong>Every run is different:</strong> Once Alzur completes the first two experiments, Curses become unlocked. These flexible difficulty modifiers ramp up the variety in each run, and provide players with a greater challenge every time.",
    "about_the_game": "GWENT: Rogue Mage is a single-player expansion to GWENT: The Witcher Card Game combining the best elements of roguelike, deckbuilding, and strategy games with the unique mechanics of GWENT card battles.<br><br>Hundreds of years before Geralt and other witchers roamed the Continent, the Conjunction of the Spheres brought endless ranks of monsters into the world. Humanity desperately needed a way to fight back the onslaught to survive.<br><br>Follow the journey of a young and ambitious mage, Alzur, and his companion Lily, who embark on a dangerous quest to create a living weapon that will eradicate the monster threat once and for all.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1711950/extras/a38980e32cbbaaa07195b4a4934c9c70.webp?t=1749201262\" /></div><br><br><strong>No holding back:</strong> Battles last only one round, so players will need to use every trick up their sleeve to help Alzur stave off the onslaught.<br><br><strong>New resource \u2014 energy:</strong> Each turn, Alzur can cast powerful spells from his ever-expanding Grimoire by spending energy. It can be replenished between battles by visiting Places of Power or through random encounters on the map.<br><br><strong>Turning the tables:</strong> Alzur starts at a disadvantage by not being able to react to the opponents\u2019 final card play. By progressing the campaign and unlocking high-end bonuses, players can take complete control of the battle flow. <br><br><strong>Every run is different:</strong> Once Alzur completes the first two experiments, Curses become unlocked. These flexible difficulty modifiers ramp up the variety in each run, and provide players with a greater challenge every time.",
    "short_description": "GWENT: Rogue Mage is a first single-player expansion to GWENT: The Witcher Card Game. It combines elements of roguelike, deckbuilding, and strategy games with GWENT card battles.",
